2 CONC rgh. ISBN 978-0-902198-84-5. page 452
2 CONT
2 CONT "<em>[http://www.westminster-abbey.org/our-history/people/sir-joseph-dalton-hooker Sir Joseph Dalton Hooker]</em>", Westminster Abbey
2 CONT
