1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Wilhelmine Auguste Christine von Klot''' was born on January 15, 1825, in Tartu, Tartu linn, Tartu County, Estonia. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-58542160 Alexander von Wilcken] and [https://www.geni.com/profil
2 CONC e-53905186 Wilhelmine Christiane Sophie von Wilcken]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wilhelmine Auguste Christine married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34635975768 Burchard von Klot] on March 3, 1849, in Tartu, Tartu linn, Tartu County, Estonia. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34635981539 Reinhold August* von Klot];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34635981549 Georg von Klot];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34635981559 Nicolai* Wilhelm von Klot];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34635981572 Alexander Wilhelm von Klot]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on February 3, 1914 in Riga, Latvia . 
2 CONT ----
