1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Burchard von Klot''' was born on October 10, 1821, in Puikeln (Puikule), Latvia. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-123507724 Magnus Ernst Reinhold (Reinhold) von Klot, a. Puikeln] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-
2 CONC 123507725 Olympia Christine von Klot]. He was a Hofner. Adv. in Riga . 
2 CONT
2 CONT Burchard married [https://www.geni.com/profile-34635981382 Wilhelmine Auguste Christine von Klot] on March 3, 1849, in Tartu, Tartu linn, Tartu County, Estonia. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34635981539 Reinhold August* von Klot];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34635981549 Georg von Klot];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34635981559 Nicolai* Wilhelm von Klot];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34635981572 Alexander Wilhelm von Klot]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on March 29, 1898 in Riga, Latvia. 
2 CONT ----
